  "name": "Furrnion",
  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Furrnion is an 18+ furry convention in Madrid, Spain, and the first Spanish furry convention. It began when two friends in a Madrid bar dared each other to organize a proper convention, and they were joined by a third. Salmy, Tronchy and Sierra of the association AFCAF built a team, and the name comes from a term used by Panda Paco for his local meets, a \"furry reunion\". The first Furrnion was held January 27 to 29, 2017, at the MC Las Provincias Hotel in Fuenlabrada, with 155 registered attendees and more than 220 including one-day visitors, against an original vision of 50. Later editions moved to the larger Hotel Meliá Barajas near the airport, and each has had a theme.",
